shadowbaritone.command.elytra.short_desc=Fly to the current goal in the Nether
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.1=The elytra command makes Baritone automatically fly to the current goal in the Nether.
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.usage=Usage:
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.example.default=> elytra - Fly to the current goal
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.example.reset=> elytra reset - Reset the process state, but try to continue flying toward the same goal.
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.example.repack=> elytra repack - Queue all chunks within render distance for processing by the native library.
shadowbaritone.command.elytra.long_desc.example.supported=> elytra supported - Tell you whether your Baritone includes native libraries compatible with your computer.
